  "summary": {
    "zh": "由弗兰克·威廉姆斯创立的独立车队，1980—1990 年代的统治力量之一。威廉姆斯与纽维、主动悬挂、雷诺 V10 紧密相连，多次夺得车手与制造商双料冠军。",
    "en": "The independent team founded by Frank Williams and a dominant force of the 1980s-90s. Linked with Newey, active suspension and the Renault V10, it took multiple driver and constructor doubles."
  },
